.DS_Store
*.log
.claude/backlog/.lock/
.claude/backlog/claims/
# The single-instance marker, never the run logs beside it. Committed, a marker makes every clone
# of this repo report that a supervisor is already driving the backlog.
.claude/backlog/runs/.active/

# Machine-local list of internal organisation and client names (0143). NEVER COMMITTED:
# the names are the secret, so a committed enumeration would be the leak the guard exists to
# stop. tests/measurement.test.sh reads it if present and skips the check if absent.
.private-names
